This project detects and classifies geometric shapes from an image using OpenCV and Python.

The system performs:
-Image preprocessing-Grayscale conversion
-Thresholding
-Contour detection
-Shape classification

Detected shapes include:
-Triangle
-Square
-Rectangle
-Pentagom
-Hexagon
-Circle

#Technologies Used
-Python
-OpenCV

# Features
-Detects multiple shapes in an image
-Draws contours around detected shapes
-Labels each detected shape
-Uses polygon approximation for classification
